# Suggested small improvements (low effort)

* Add `NULL` checks for `h` and `h->hspi` in `spi_txrx` and other helper functions.&#x20;
* After `WriteRegister`, do a `ReadRegister` and compare to ensure the write took effect.&#x20;
* Replace DRDY polling with an EXTI interrupt so you service samples at the correct rate.&#x20;
* Make SPI transfers timeboxed (pass a configurable timeout instead of `HAL_MAX_DELAY`).&#x20;

